{
  "schema": "tennislive.voice-quality.v1.inventory",
  "bundle_sha256": "56b561780a5d34265b00cda75e7ae96123942f09688bc54ed72d5ba40da162bb",
  "bundle_request_count": 22,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:02b9fe40c93624e29effda0c6eb9629e44a1cace35c7d4b82002039b9315f35f",
      "request_id": "02b9fe40c93624e29effda0c6eb9629e44a1cace35c7d4b82002039b9315f35f",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "984b2d5b3265bc7762feb978aa8ba811",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而佩古拉完全不知道，这段话正通过 WTA 自己的频道，直播给所有人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "9f77b4603fd9e45a4ba14049d1b5b582bc7ec34a32705829783b1749de012605",
      "words_sha256": "91ce543f652d52982408612f35be7b694fca275b51aa8de1bdfb4fd14a5e5aa1"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:26370fdd3c47ab98e6bd099cd3dfacaf13ed632873039c5b7e6a5cf8e0f75522",
      "request_id": "26370fdd3c47ab98e6bd099cd3dfacaf13ed632873039c5b7e6a5cf8e0f75522",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f2220946df7f5620a1899ff3a303e9cc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "于是这几天，世界排名最靠前的几位球员在训练场上说的悄悄话，被全世界听了个清清楚楚。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c80a1b2d90c02fa12d66b4394cd61f10eed923fb61df8a6c159915ff817a85db",
      "words_sha256": "99b45e32269e94aa03791ddf291b9b80cd2a3fea4f0744bf217aa6f2244190ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2a0c10817b7dbd2351f52ad192043c89839e4c46c66e703b00c691110da25563",
      "request_id": "2a0c10817b7dbd2351f52ad192043c89839e4c46c66e703b00c691110da25563",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "65749793b6d5abec7ccac50f1ad7ae57",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "WTA 的反应很快：频道上的训练直播全部下架，声明紧跟着来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fc13a4958ea552c7241173cec75f9477e3e1fd998d33c68d7ed126ef8be351be",
      "words_sha256": "7690529d14a6f65e7dfeb2d481e291e25c26da642ac134ce21a3c3bb592b99d4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:31cbc39d8b869b6531351bd9b8299ad85d41f224bdb2e0d7bcc785d9b7cb3003",
      "request_id": "31cbc39d8b869b6531351bd9b8299ad85d41f224bdb2e0d7bcc785d9b7cb3003",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4acbb2dbebbb579e1d160907d4199943",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "语气冲得完全不像她平时说话的样子。这段为什么传得格外快？因为武科夫这个名字自带前情：去年年初，他刚被 WTA 调查过——查的正是他对待莱巴金娜的方式，一度被停职，去年八月才解除。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "0f4bc1b80bf71f6f52462c54a62fa3ad98f4f2a5781fade82dce319f74908c8f",
      "words_sha256": "91ce899a2b606dc5d938c24e18bdf7905d38619c9b583542285ba023538421b7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:40868ce45a0d672e23b2d94a14488849e7a2df5cd225188670a0aa0c7e62c56b",
      "request_id": "40868ce45a0d672e23b2d94a14488849e7a2df5cd225188670a0aa0c7e62c56b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "412948aa9a3c7a3e843a47e82612702f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在，总决赛周日开打。佩古拉在第一组，首场就打高芙；安德列娃在第二组。两个人想碰面，最早要等到半决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d7c09afaf7eda164e53e8a90294ace37b84f7b9bda5646e1e261d89c68119b14",
      "words_sha256": "031aed777366b5042a92aff494c48f15f1d925d6f994e4c3588b3b24b13d7a76"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:479ed3f2f1b53d7b29b290748298836d8695771fe2b07e7c3e973bfd5f313e88",
      "request_id": "479ed3f2f1b53d7b29b290748298836d8695771fe2b07e7c3e973bfd5f313e88",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "05d732867d04edf9b49a6ff7195af8da",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说，这个姑娘人不错，就是有点被惯坏了的范儿，总要有人敲打敲打。她对马丁内斯也少了点尊重——球员冲教练发火，教练不拦着，反而像在拱火。最狠的一句是。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2b53ecf57d019febdbe5e9204ffd9d97b715f39779b7208478beea1041b10a6c",
      "words_sha256": "e4368eeab88f90fae2b505b69efe34d68880daff9ecf74e10cfa7906a77a9014"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:48e24eeb5aa1dbe8214fa60c8fa835140f578d0c9514760bddca4e472b17cbff",
      "request_id": "48e24eeb5aa1dbe8214fa60c8fa835140f578d0c9514760bddca4e472b17cbff",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6faaaccee23947f1c1dd687611a5b123",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先流出的是佩古拉。周三，她刚和安德列娃合练完——练球局里，安德列娃连下四局，还冲着自己的教练马丁内斯发了火。训练一结束，佩古拉留下跟教练诺尔斯复盘，话越说越直。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "42cef8c018971f4c3b43d9ce7f30e2c7dd6b625dc2445cccbc419d7524c2cd1b",
      "words_sha256": "19090a5d42d5899bb8c443bf8e17b75c54d7c2c64c920cd675786f88c7cb5332"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:53a53a4e40a4c8f9777a59ef574c3fba3106b7ca746bb8c29e3a8ff174e48f11",
      "request_id": "53a53a4e40a4c8f9777a59ef574c3fba3106b7ca746bb8c29e3a8ff174e48f11",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "de26885c0def1cea8de49c1a5a4445e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "总决赛还没开打，先出事的是训练场。印第安维尔斯，官方把八位球员的训练全程直播——画面有，声音也有，只是没人告诉球员，场边的麦克风开着。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "5cdb8e786244f6f636986f29002269529685a3ffa01ccae0efa438eb75ff41dc",
      "words_sha256": "1e78609ad06e2ef1749b782ea9c99a35b6a9a1e4c8318fdb258f5b77cc72db33"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:72f894d2a4725b33c88cee4d41bcb77d4913c7975cd31fa08ad099a6c3c02ffa",
      "request_id": "72f894d2a4725b33c88cee4d41bcb77d4913c7975cd31fa08ad099a6c3c02ffa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "782a20f590357cd80558453658212018",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年一月的澳网，高芙输球后特意躲到自以为没镜头的地方连砸了七把拍子，全被播了出去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "084c612272ccda9e296444b969f2acc866246ee2ed718dce79a08cc1bc47eea6",
      "words_sha256": "33c82c42b6bf504be3139329f44d96a8e37b77215e22de6d5e5247d2299f9765"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7796740a7a6e78b751880804ee77413282e0f12511b6fb91740b017634b2c0be",
      "request_id": "7796740a7a6e78b751880804ee77413282e0f12511b6fb91740b017634b2c0be",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8d5182842748ec722478ea40d5072d6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "声明还补了一句：麦克风本来只想收击球的环境声。可片段早被球迷录屏传遍全网，删，是删不回来了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b7eb394b02d84767d85f455239a44c191638b12fb5a82e1c7fadf0aa38068dac",
      "words_sha256": "4dc1795927ef7fee8222958e2fbdbdf96d31bcbdda37e0a233273c20aa3eaf82"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:79b6815df021419e1e6a02346ed3a8d65495a0bee5a7a0973729b61ed9ef4117",
      "request_id": "79b6815df021419e1e6a02346ed3a8d65495a0bee5a7a0973729b61ed9ef4117",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea9e16851cff7599d6b18e14be2a0282",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说自己不是摄像头的粉丝，「除了洗澡和上厕所，你永远在被拍」。那一次，WTA 主席还公开表态支持球员的隐私权。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "b04f2ade50e090cc713c729b8739308939d376943b524e0e955929f595151d91",
      "words_sha256": "af55eea02625eab31f0ae3d38ebc2ee06600cf0f7b82dc9879446e23f4127831"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7a418c997c17c19a964ad8385a5ec6db0729220f20120c0f0cd78c03cdf4c4cf",
      "request_id": "7a418c997c17c19a964ad8385a5ec6db0729220f20120c0f0cd78c03cdf4c4cf",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2f1f0e808f7fe8a619e5530642d447d2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二条更短，就一句：停下这个。一句话，把这件事从「谁说错了话」，拉回到「谁有权把话播出去」。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c4e487fa1a12ba6271bc57e73b23d344d7cff839a6abacb29ad13e455687b2a6",
      "words_sha256": "bb57e923ee359970e8fd81336f97c890ab16987755fd7e23a28768276631510b"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7bedb632cfb4fc80b277e32dcb29fd30cc82634eb8052e6d9518238a1fc3aafe",
      "request_id": "7bedb632cfb4fc80b277e32dcb29fd30cc82634eb8052e6d9518238a1fc3aafe",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2a6ac7dde6dd9e67dda186bc4742a0e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "话已经漏出去了，球还照打。所以最后一个问题留给你：训练直播，你站哪边——带声音才真实、才圈粉，幕后就该给球迷看？还是冯德罗索娃那句：看比赛可以，听悄悄话不行？评论区，站队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3dbcfd1837637b78ad6301e5f683067d072bd9a14814f482b9fb95b5bad228ba",
      "words_sha256": "278cca357182de4478a5e198fd5567c6b59dfcd5cf0cad0164805a2061980653"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:7e4fce78e23676c94538befb42f76e61c902a99ad4b3138dad660f40889330f6",
      "request_id": "7e4fce78e23676c94538befb42f76e61c902a99ad4b3138dad660f40889330f6",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e62ffd5e5d78b218bcf3f80d3fa79ece",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "被调查的是教练怎么对球员，这一次被全网听见的，是球员怎么吼教练。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "140fd86cb7ceae95f59fb4a8b4ce6913f43e8322cfa3fb368b5b098d22e56869",
      "words_sha256": "6521b6a574b7beb6c2c2e91b8c9909f87b12aff4f7bb0120f444a5286a91859c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:87a48b887e65b541fb9df9f3f6010eb11e506a58277e40d84817ef9c63ae2cd5",
      "request_id": "87a48b887e65b541fb9df9f3f6010eb11e506a58277e40d84817ef9c63ae2cd5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "77464644db652df457a1ede42e64ce61",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二段流出的，是世界第一莱巴金娜。她和诺斯科娃合练，往网前走的时候，冲教练武科夫喊。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "78ab03e702d13613cea11dde3c7d84432feee0edcdcd3b1a09bd3ae8113d4629",
      "words_sha256": "f648eac0ed017772f876ba60067c19681a43827f035a994d4b69cc030a8c925a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:9f2b1963cdcee13ff25906f200870dea077789fed1471f1996b886be7287ed16",
      "request_id": "9f2b1963cdcee13ff25906f200870dea077789fed1471f1996b886be7287ed16",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "99cf31df152c962bb08b981e3dcb0e17",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "吵得最响的，反而是一个不在总决赛名单里的人。前温网冠军冯德罗索娃，直接在社交媒体上点名 WTA。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "aa9286131b111c1d84fcc54cc721fa2f5d99bb9f22cbe3caeec557dcf76d268c",
      "words_sha256": "e90cd53c854a7a094cc33429deffc79e290ab3f551e3cd7efbcde276c7a12ff2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "46e1135e020258d35607049a4b123831abc769b1150c389d3d463be311363981",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:cc97b523ab51a337f0974e1150e19baac3d498a2951ec9bb81c99f39c02c28db",
      "request_id": "cc97b523ab51a337f0974e1150e19baac3d498a2951ec9bb81c99f39c02c28db",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "99f367c8e0c81e6093607414ea082003",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实训练直播不是新鲜事，美网、公开赛都在做，惯例是收环境声，给球迷一个看热身的窗口。真正的老问题，是镜头和麦克风的边界。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d9eb81ca9f03a403a9b076dfecb07c6d57f2e5a3abca53be4683c95ccb7a342b",
      "words_sha256": "715f6e39f0ec604fdc12829e0df4def5a1365124c08d7ee5cf463f4fe16e6c4c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e0e2fdbd5523f660414df93854902c382733a06c5e652f3ea143e7a8cc9ddb58",
      "request_id": "e0e2fdbd5523f660414df93854902c382733a06c5e652f3ea143e7a8cc9ddb58",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ac76f50d5d590b264cfd1672211b4a81",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十个月后，轮到佩古拉自己，在 WTA 自家的旗舰赛事上，栽进了同一个坑里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3f63ee6318e6d0df233cf22fa134386b5f5000047d0932867361a9037884131f",
      "words_sha256": "4ce606a4d365c1cde37b4aaa214e74296a2ee7071d6d0c436d7562ce6fa6c973"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e47e165da08c57f1c6ef23a67f9cd4f949eeaba96fc32066c4de819aa098a72b",
      "request_id": "e47e165da08c57f1c6ef23a67f9cd4f949eeaba96fc32066c4de819aa098a72b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "15f9789d54d492f0a854fc9ccb16567e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "看比赛可以，听悄悄话不行——冯德罗索娃把话说死了",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3a2d5d9b61de9434109611a8658a639ef2dd61b9f2f52b6e797f5ac5548e88c5",
      "words_sha256": "24ae6fbb6ee86b841b2586ea92981a1972fbd3d4ff0d205ffb0c9c0f74280c90"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:f9663c594594c96eb62b778618d1ff0b3e5dff2013524a919be0cd0cbaf2d836",
      "request_id": "f9663c594594c96eb62b778618d1ff0b3e5dff2013524a919be0cd0cbaf2d836",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1fea69d869b6ee6c0c7decafda6c741c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "佩古拉那边，经纪人说得很清楚：她完全不知道自己在被直播；事后她已经亲自联系了安德列娃和马丁内斯道歉——没通过媒体，是私下联系的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a7088fa5e5ad4184a6061b8fbd6c7c8261d9431ee8702bcd3245471645186bdb",
      "words_sha256": "f046ef20d1b5564555429cf54abb2af1e478759859369c95af719e4c2e01f568"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fc19a11294e5669e202739570fef640577b88b359461468b0143a0741510a67e",
      "request_id": "fc19a11294e5669e202739570fef640577b88b359461468b0143a0741510a67e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "346fe152b53a604877f1b74fd03c6903",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "斯瓦泰克当时说：我们到底是网球运动员，还是动物园里连上厕所都被围观的动物？而站出来声援高芙的人里，就有佩古拉——球员理事会成员。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "4803de95a67e95fdf404a9c246d4daac13cae3e45fad5f45b471a1637c5ce495",
      "words_sha256": "34e027fe177c9ccf78bdc2f257503ad56b11f1c8872ed32e10f67527c2c1fe5c"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_00.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "5cdb8e786244f6f636986f29002269529685a3ffa01ccae0efa438eb75ff41dc",
      "words_sha256": "1e78609ad06e2ef1749b782ea9c99a35b6a9a1e4c8318fdb258f5b77cc72db33",
      "words_path": "voice_00.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "de26885c0def1cea8de49c1a5a4445e7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "总决赛还没开打，先出事的是训练场。印第安维尔斯，官方把八位球员的训练全程直播——画面有，声音也有，只是没人告诉球员，场边的麦克风开着。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_01.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c80a1b2d90c02fa12d66b4394cd61f10eed923fb61df8a6c159915ff817a85db",
      "words_sha256": "99b45e32269e94aa03791ddf291b9b80cd2a3fea4f0744bf217aa6f2244190ed",
      "words_path": "voice_01.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f2220946df7f5620a1899ff3a303e9cc",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "于是这几天，世界排名最靠前的几位球员在训练场上说的悄悄话，被全世界听了个清清楚楚。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "42cef8c018971f4c3b43d9ce7f30e2c7dd6b625dc2445cccbc419d7524c2cd1b",
      "words_sha256": "19090a5d42d5899bb8c443bf8e17b75c54d7c2c64c920cd675786f88c7cb5332",
      "words_path": "voice_02.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6faaaccee23947f1c1dd687611a5b123",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "先流出的是佩古拉。周三，她刚和安德列娃合练完——练球局里，安德列娃连下四局，还冲着自己的教练马丁内斯发了火。训练一结束，佩古拉留下跟教练诺尔斯复盘，话越说越直。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "2b53ecf57d019febdbe5e9204ffd9d97b715f39779b7208478beea1041b10a6c",
      "words_sha256": "e4368eeab88f90fae2b505b69efe34d68880daff9ecf74e10cfa7906a77a9014",
      "words_path": "voice_04.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "05d732867d04edf9b49a6ff7195af8da",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说，这个姑娘人不错，就是有点被惯坏了的范儿，总要有人敲打敲打。她对马丁内斯也少了点尊重——球员冲教练发火，教练不拦着，反而像在拱火。最狠的一句是。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "9f77b4603fd9e45a4ba14049d1b5b582bc7ec34a32705829783b1749de012605",
      "words_sha256": "91ce543f652d52982408612f35be7b694fca275b51aa8de1bdfb4fd14a5e5aa1",
      "words_path": "voice_06.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "984b2d5b3265bc7762feb978aa8ba811",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "而佩古拉完全不知道，这段话正通过 WTA 自己的频道，直播给所有人。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "78ab03e702d13613cea11dde3c7d84432feee0edcdcd3b1a09bd3ae8113d4629",
      "words_sha256": "f648eac0ed017772f876ba60067c19681a43827f035a994d4b69cc030a8c925a",
      "words_path": "voice_07.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "77464644db652df457a1ede42e64ce61",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二段流出的，是世界第一莱巴金娜。她和诺斯科娃合练，往网前走的时候，冲教练武科夫喊。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "0f4bc1b80bf71f6f52462c54a62fa3ad98f4f2a5781fade82dce319f74908c8f",
      "words_sha256": "91ce899a2b606dc5d938c24e18bdf7905d38619c9b583542285ba023538421b7",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4acbb2dbebbb579e1d160907d4199943",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "语气冲得完全不像她平时说话的样子。这段为什么传得格外快？因为武科夫这个名字自带前情：去年年初，他刚被 WTA 调查过——查的正是他对待莱巴金娜的方式，一度被停职，去年八月才解除。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "140fd86cb7ceae95f59fb4a8b4ce6913f43e8322cfa3fb368b5b098d22e56869",
      "words_sha256": "6521b6a574b7beb6c2c2e91b8c9909f87b12aff4f7bb0120f444a5286a91859c",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e62ffd5e5d78b218bcf3f80d3fa79ece",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "被调查的是教练怎么对球员，这一次被全网听见的，是球员怎么吼教练。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "fc13a4958ea552c7241173cec75f9477e3e1fd998d33c68d7ed126ef8be351be",
      "words_sha256": "7690529d14a6f65e7dfeb2d481e291e25c26da642ac134ce21a3c3bb592b99d4",
      "words_path": "voice_11.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "65749793b6d5abec7ccac50f1ad7ae57",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "WTA 的反应很快：频道上的训练直播全部下架，声明紧跟着来。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b7eb394b02d84767d85f455239a44c191638b12fb5a82e1c7fadf0aa38068dac",
      "words_sha256": "4dc1795927ef7fee8222958e2fbdbdf96d31bcbdda37e0a233273c20aa3eaf82",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e8d5182842748ec722478ea40d5072d6",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "声明还补了一句：麦克风本来只想收击球的环境声。可片段早被球迷录屏传遍全网，删，是删不回来了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "a7088fa5e5ad4184a6061b8fbd6c7c8261d9431ee8702bcd3245471645186bdb",
      "words_sha256": "f046ef20d1b5564555429cf54abb2af1e478759859369c95af719e4c2e01f568",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "1fea69d869b6ee6c0c7decafda6c741c",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "佩古拉那边，经纪人说得很清楚：她完全不知道自己在被直播；事后她已经亲自联系了安德列娃和马丁内斯道歉——没通过媒体，是私下联系的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "aa9286131b111c1d84fcc54cc721fa2f5d99bb9f22cbe3caeec557dcf76d268c",
      "words_sha256": "e90cd53c854a7a094cc33429deffc79e290ab3f551e3cd7efbcde276c7a12ff2",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "99cf31df152c962bb08b981e3dcb0e17",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "吵得最响的，反而是一个不在总决赛名单里的人。前温网冠军冯德罗索娃，直接在社交媒体上点名 WTA。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "c4e487fa1a12ba6271bc57e73b23d344d7cff839a6abacb29ad13e455687b2a6",
      "words_sha256": "bb57e923ee359970e8fd81336f97c890ab16987755fd7e23a28768276631510b",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2f1f0e808f7fe8a619e5530642d447d2",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二条更短，就一句：停下这个。一句话，把这件事从「谁说错了话」，拉回到「谁有权把话播出去」。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d9eb81ca9f03a403a9b076dfecb07c6d57f2e5a3abca53be4683c95ccb7a342b",
      "words_sha256": "715f6e39f0ec604fdc12829e0df4def5a1365124c08d7ee5cf463f4fe16e6c4c",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "99f367c8e0c81e6093607414ea082003",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "其实训练直播不是新鲜事，美网、公开赛都在做，惯例是收环境声，给球迷一个看热身的窗口。真正的老问题，是镜头和麦克风的边界。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "084c612272ccda9e296444b969f2acc866246ee2ed718dce79a08cc1bc47eea6",
      "words_sha256": "33c82c42b6bf504be3139329f44d96a8e37b77215e22de6d5e5247d2299f9765",
      "words_path": "voice_19.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "782a20f590357cd80558453658212018",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "今年一月的澳网，高芙输球后特意躲到自以为没镜头的地方连砸了七把拍子，全被播了出去。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "4803de95a67e95fdf404a9c246d4daac13cae3e45fad5f45b471a1637c5ce495",
      "words_sha256": "34e027fe177c9ccf78bdc2f257503ad56b11f1c8872ed32e10f67527c2c1fe5c",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "346fe152b53a604877f1b74fd03c6903",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "斯瓦泰克当时说：我们到底是网球运动员，还是动物园里连上厕所都被围观的动物？而站出来声援高芙的人里，就有佩古拉——球员理事会成员。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "b04f2ade50e090cc713c729b8739308939d376943b524e0e955929f595151d91",
      "words_sha256": "af55eea02625eab31f0ae3d38ebc2ee06600cf0f7b82dc9879446e23f4127831",
      "words_path": "voice_21.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ea9e16851cff7599d6b18e14be2a0282",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说自己不是摄像头的粉丝，「除了洗澡和上厕所，你永远在被拍」。那一次，WTA 主席还公开表态支持球员的隐私权。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3f63ee6318e6d0df233cf22fa134386b5f5000047d0932867361a9037884131f",
      "words_sha256": "4ce606a4d365c1cde37b4aaa214e74296a2ee7071d6d0c436d7562ce6fa6c973",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "ac76f50d5d590b264cfd1672211b4a81",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "十个月后，轮到佩古拉自己，在 WTA 自家的旗舰赛事上，栽进了同一个坑里。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d7c09afaf7eda164e53e8a90294ace37b84f7b9bda5646e1e261d89c68119b14",
      "words_sha256": "031aed777366b5042a92aff494c48f15f1d925d6f994e4c3588b3b24b13d7a76",
      "words_path": "voice_23.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "412948aa9a3c7a3e843a47e82612702f",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "现在，总决赛周日开打。佩古拉在第一组，首场就打高芙；安德列娃在第二组。两个人想碰面，最早要等到半决赛。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3dbcfd1837637b78ad6301e5f683067d072bd9a14814f482b9fb95b5bad228ba",
      "words_sha256": "278cca357182de4478a5e198fd5567c6b59dfcd5cf0cad0164805a2061980653",
      "words_path": "voice_24.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c2a6ac7dde6dd9e67dda186bc4742a0e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+10Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "话已经漏出去了，球还照打。所以最后一个问题留给你：训练直播，你站哪边——带声音才真实、才圈粉，幕后就该给球迷看？还是冯德罗索娃那句：看比赛可以，听悄悄话不行？评论区，站队。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_cover.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "3a2d5d9b61de9434109611a8658a639ef2dd61b9f2f52b6e797f5ac5548e88c5",
      "words_sha256": "24ae6fbb6ee86b841b2586ea92981a1972fbd3d4ff0d205ffb0c9c0f74280c90",
      "words_path": "voice_cover.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "15f9789d54d492f0a854fc9ccb16567e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "看比赛可以，听悄悄话不行——冯德罗索娃把话说死了",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_outro.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "46e1135e020258d35607049a4b123831abc769b1150c389d3d463be311363981",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8",
      "words_path": "voice_outro.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    }
  ]
}
